This directory is a clean-room method sketch of ideas from:

  Tunçtürk, Burkay; Aslansefat, Koorosh; Papadopoulos, Yiannis; Nguyen, Bao.
  "More Agents, More Reliable? System-Level Reliability of Multi-Agent
  LLMs under Operational-Profile Uncertainty."
  arXiv:2611.07140 (4 November 2026).
  https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.07140
  HTML: https://arxiv.org/html/2611.07140

Quoted paper sentences in fixtures.py are attributed to that arXiv HTML
version and were checked against it on 2026-11-07.

This sketch does not include upstream source. Paper section 7 (Code
Availability) names:

  https://github.com/Bruhkay/hip-llm-multiagent-reliability
  https://github.com/koo-ec/HIP_HOPS_LLM

Neither repository is vendored or ported here. This is not a
reproduction of the paper's 270-call ECHA / LangGraph case study or of
Table 1(a).

No upstream copyright owner is claimed or invented for this sketch. The
arXiv HTML page states: "This work has been submitted to the IEEE for
possible publication. Copyright may be transferred without notice, after
which this version may no longer be accessible."
